AnnihilatingUniverse: {
	DisplayName: Annihilating Universe
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Arrows leave a brilliant star at the impact point after hitting an enemy
		Right-click to destroy enemies with the Devourer's power
		'''
}

BarrenBow: {
	DisplayName: Barren Bow
	Tooltip: The arrows fired will burst out a barren current when they hit the enemy
}

AvalancheM60: {
	DisplayName: Avalanche M60
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Use snowballs as ammunition.
		Firing a barrage of snowballs,
		Firepower increasing as ammunition diminishes.
		Every 20 shots triggers an overdrive surge,
		Creating a small avalanche.
		"Denji, let's have a snowball fight."
		'''
}

CrystalDimming: {
	DisplayName: Crystal Dimming
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Use snowballs as ammunition
		Fires crystal shells that raise glacier spikes from the ground at the point of impact
		Spikes grow taller when raised near existing crystal clusters
		Right-click unleashes a glacial surge, raising an ever-taller ridge of ice along the terrain
		"The earth remembers every frost"
		'''
}

DarkFrostSolstice: {
	DisplayName: Dark Frost Solstice
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Use snowballs as ammunition.
		Firing hail and polar flames,
		Every 20 shots triggers an overdrive surge,
		Summoning wintry divinity at the mouse cursor.
		'''
}

SnowQuay: {
	DisplayName: Snow Viper M16
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Use snowballs as ammunition
		Hold left-click to blow a dense stream of snow at your enemies
		Blowing snow builds up pressure in the packing chamber
		Release left-click with enough pressure to launch a packed snowball shell
		"Winter's joy begins with a snowblower"
		'''
}

NeutronBow: {
	DisplayName: Roche's String
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Fires gravity arrows that generate gamma rays upon hitting a target.
		Right-click to perform a three-level charge, releasing three powerful gravity arrows when fully charged.
		'''
	Lang1: Trapping gravity
	Lang2: Is making gravity yield
	Lang3: Finished!!
}

NeutronGun: {
	DisplayName: Stellar Hunter
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Fires gravity projectiles that create warp points upon hitting a target.
		Right-click to switch to sniper mode, firing more powerful gravity bullets that summon gamma rays upon impact.
		Each shot charges the gun, and when fully charged, the next shot triggers a neutron star explosion at the cursor.
		"Shoot the sun down!"
		'''
}

MG42: {
	DisplayName: MG42
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Continuous firing causes the barrel to overheat
		Turning musket bullets into armor-piercing bullets
		'''
}

SnowQuayMK2: {
	DisplayName: Snow Quay MK2
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Use snowballs as ammunition
		A military refit with a cryo-compressor that casts snowballs into high-velocity icicles
		Left-click fires three-round bursts; the final round is a heavy spike that bursts into crystals
		Right-click vents an overpressure scatter of short-ranged icicles
		"The second-generation Snow Viper no longer needs preheating"
		'''
}

Starship: {
	DisplayName: Starship
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Continuously firing builds heat, increasing fire rate over time
		Right-click to consume ammo and load a comet shell; the next shot fires it for massive damage and inflicts Hyper-Disintegration
		At peak heat, two escort wingmen fly alongside firing homing star bolts; planets are periodically hurled from behind you
		Releasing the trigger unleashes the finale: 14 defense-ignoring homing meteors and a micro-galaxy rain down at the cursor
		'''
}

DuneStalker: {
	DisplayName: Dune Stalker
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Fires a chain-bound hookhead instead of consuming the ammunition outright
		The hook tears through enemies along its path, then automatically reels back on impact or once it reaches its maximum range
		'''
}

Snowblindness: {
	DisplayName: Snow Blindness
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Fires snowballs and frost beams at high frequency
		On hit, generates multiple EX frost beams around the target
		"Lost in the blizzard, an eternal wait, a painful map, a sharp turn,
		cracked lenses, dried bloodstains, red ice, a crying beaver, a shadow in the ice"
		'''
}

RaiderGun: {
	DisplayName: Raider
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Converts musket balls into high-speed bullets
		Right click to roll dash and reload the magazine
		The first bullet fired after rolling is converted into a Destroyer Grenade
		"Perfect for indoor hostage rescues"
		'''
}

HyperionBarrage: {
	DisplayName: Hyperion Auto-Turret
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Fires thermal cruise missiles that detonate on impact and ignite enemies
		Every fourth trigger pull vertically launches a salvo of three missiles that dive onto your crosshair
		"Make full use of everything"
		'''
}

RaiderGunEX: {
	DisplayName: Raider EX
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Converts musket balls into high-speed bullets
		Additionally fires a barrage of Destroyer Homing Missiles
		Right click to roll dash and reload the magazine
		The first bullet fired after rolling is converted into a Destroyer Grenade
		"Carpet bombing"
		'''
}

Dicoria: {
	DisplayName: Dicoria
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Fires dual bullets, can be charged
		Fully charged shots release a thermal beam
		"By the way, won't this make us cross-eyed?"
		'''
}

BloodshotBomb: {
	DisplayName: Bloodshot Bomb
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Lights its fuse the moment you hold it; the fuse burns through three stages, roughly two seconds each
		The shorter the fuse, the redder the eye, the fiercer the blast, and the more flesh it flings
		Throw anytime with left click; it bursts on contact, and only biting into flesh sends chunks flying
		If the fuse burns out while you are still holding on, it goes off in your hand
		"It can't bear to leave you"
		'''
	SelfBoom: "{0} took one look too many"
}

LaserPistol: {
	DisplayName: Laser Pistol
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Expend energy to shoot lasers and penetrate multiple enemies
		"Utilization is not high."
		'''
}

HyperionBarrageEX: {
	DisplayName: Hyperion Barrage EX
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Fires heavy cruise missiles that burst into six self-locking cluster missiles on detonation
		"Beyond its intended use"
		'''
}

SporeBubbleBlaster: {
	DisplayName: Spore Bubble Blaster
	Tooltip: Sprays a stream of spore airflow
}

FungalRevolver: {
	DisplayName: Fungal Revolver
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Converts Musket Balls into fungal rounds
		"Cleaning it only made it worse"
		'''
}

Pallbearer: {
	DisplayName: Pallbearer
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Hold left-click to load and charge, loosing a near-instant heavy bolt that punches through your quarry and sears a blood brand
		Right-click to hurl the crossbow, letting the casket's breath cling to your guest
		Three brands on the same target bring the coffin down
		"Also known as the Coffin Carrier"
		'''
}

UniversalFrost: {
	DisplayName: Universal Frost
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Use snowballs as ammunition
		Left-click rapidly fires frost glimmers, each shot charging the frost dome
		Once fully charged, right-click unfurls an aurora curtain above the cursor
		The curtain rains frost lances upon enemies beneath it
		"When all creation falls silent, only the aurora still flows across the sky"
		'''
}

SneezingWyrm: {
	DisplayName: Sneezing Wyrm
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Rapidly fires searing wyrmstrike rounds
		Sustained fire stokes the barrel hotter, pushing the tracers from orange toward blue-white
		With every gathered breath, the wyrm huffs a weaving, seeking bolt of dragonbreath down the line of fire
		Smoke tickles the old snout into intermittent sneezes that vent thick fumes to the side
		"Don't stand on its sneezing side"
		'''
}

TiroFinale: {
	DisplayName: Tiro Finale
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Benefits from both ranged and magic damage bonuses
		Firing consumes ammo and mana, weaving two golden phantom muskets into the formation orbiting you with every shot
		The formation holds up to eight muskets; until it is full they hold position without firing
		Once full, every shot makes the two oldest phantom muskets fire at your cursor right after you
		Each phantom musket rings once and dissolves into light, and a fresh one is woven in its place
		Right click to condense at least four phantom muskets into a great cannon and play the finale; the more muskets, the harder it hits
		"Mind your manners, and make the curtain call magnificent"
		'''
}

Undertow: {
	DisplayName: Undertow
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Turns any arrow into an abyssal spine
		When a spine strikes an enemy, its wake collapses into a small cavitation bubble that bursts again
		Hold right click to charge; release at full draw to loose a depth-pressure spine at 3x damage
		The heavy spine pierces everything and drags enemies toward its path
		When it finally stops, it detonates a cavitation implosion
		"The sea does not push you away; it takes you in"
		'''
}

Thornstring: {
	DisplayName: Thornstring
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Turns any arrow into a thorn arrow
		Thorn arrows burst into short needles on both sides when they strike
		Hold right click to draw fully, then release a piercing heavy thorn arrow at 2.5x damage
		The heavy arrow blooms a ring of petals on every strike and where it lands
		"The string is a vine, the arrow a thorn, the bow a flower that refuses to wither"
		'''
}
